        "ggzLCaSJYfN_text": "any last <i>questions?</i>",
        "ggR790PGZII_text": "<p>Premium Himalayan Shilajit Gummies is the first clean and verified Shilajit Gummies that really works.</p>",
        "ggRt1Q8KnAf_label": "<p>TRY SHILAJIT GUMMIES TODAY!</p>",
        "ggQx3wizmdL_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
        "ggrNAk8mGLQ_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>",
        "ggvPDhlhaSo_childItem_0": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "ggya6CHenIG_childItem_0": "<p>Over 137,235+ Happy Customers</p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_0": "<p><strong>How is Wellness Nest Premium Himalayan Shilajit Gummies different from other shilajit gummies?</strong></p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_1": "<p><strong>What can I expect in terms of results and timeline?</strong></p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_2": "<p>Is Shilajit safe to take alongside HRT or other medications?</p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Can it help with intimacy-related symptoms like vaginal dryness?</strong></p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_4": "<p><strong>What about the “weird” symptoms — tingling skin, metallic taste, palpitations, bladder leaks?</strong></p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_5": "<p>How do I take it? What's the recommended dosage?</p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_6": "<p><strong>Why focus on fulvic acid for women’s health?</strong></p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_7": "<p>Is it third-party tested and authentic?</p>",
        "gguCq7UQvn3_childItem_8": "<p><strong>What if it doesn't work for me?</strong></p>",
        "gg4h7MxiKJY_text": "<p>We formulate specifically for women over 40. Our proprietary low-temperature extraction preserves phytoestrogens and the full spectrum of fulvic acid. Every batch is independently tested by Eurofins and the results are published — something no other brand offers. Plus, our formulation is guided by a medical advisory board including OB-GYNs and Ayurvedic specialists.</p>",
        "gglrPbY6kev_text": "<p>Most women notice early improvements in sleep, hot flashes, and mood within 2–4 weeks. Deeper symptoms — vaginal dryness, joint pain, hair changes, weight resistance, bladder issues — typically improve at 6–12 weeks. Our 5-month survey showed the most comprehensive results at months 3–5.</p>",
        "ggZJq9VE41o_text": "<p>Himalayan Shilajit Gummies provides trace minerals as cofactors for hormone metabolism. It is not a hormone replacement. If you’re on HRT, antidepressants, or thyroid medication, consult your healthcare provider before adding any supplement.</p>",
        "ggMZeLj4lUS_text": "<p>Yes. Fulvic acid supports cellular hydration and estrogen metabolism at the tissue level. Many women in our survey reported noticeable improvements in comfort, lubrication, and desire within 6–8 weeks.</p>",
        "ggHhACD52nO_text": "<p>These “invisible” menopause symptoms are linked to trace mineral depletion affecting nerve function, sensory processing, and bladder tissue. Magnesium deficiency alone can cause tingling, palpitations, and altered taste. Many women report these improving first, within 4–6 weeks.</p>",
        "ggvmAOqT3XQ_text": "<p>Take a pea-sized portion (approximately 300-500mg) dissolved in warm water, tea, or milk once daily — preferably in the morning. Consistency is key. One jar lasts approximately 30 days with daily use. For optimal results, we recommend committing to at least 90 days of consistent use.</p>",
        "gge6tFyTez2_text": "<p>Fulvic acid makes trace minerals bioavailable at the cellular level. Without it, many mineral supplements pass right through you. This is why women who’ve tried zinc, magnesium, and iron individually often see a difference with Himalayan Shilajit Gummies.</p>",
        "ggx_9-MtRGA_text": "<p>Every batch undergoes independent third-party testing for heavy metals, microbial contamination, and Fulvic Acid potency. Lab reports are published on our website.</p>",
        "gg-hbo8c4UK_text": "<p>We offer a full 90-day money-back guarantee — no questions asked. If you don't feel a meaningful difference within 90 days, contact us for a complete refund. We stand behind our product because the science and our 16,500+ customers already do.</p>"
      }
    },
