        "ggAZOAfYFgt_text": "<p>Batch: 847 of 20,000 pouches remaining</p>",
        "gg99i5zOsim_text": "<strong>The Shilajit Gummies You Can Actually Verify — Full Lab Report. Matching Purity</strong>",
        "ggMBhPYAUcS_text": "<p>Premium Himalayan Shilajit Gummies feature Grade-A Purified Himalayan Shilajit, Ashwagandha, Organic Ginseng, Gokshura, Black Musli &amp; more. Every batch tested. Every dose transparent.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Full Lab Report. Matching Purity.</strong><br>We publish our Eurofins lab results for every production batch. Each jar includes a batch ID you can cross-reference with our database. Verify fulvic acid content, heavy metal absence, and microbial safety — yourself.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>No other women's Shilajit brand offers this level of radical transparency. Because if you can't verify it, why would you trust it?</p>",
        "ggCNYAdtr5J_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Frame_1000003454_1.webp",
        "gg_CK27Uqqh_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
        "ggv676XTw3S_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>",
        "ggH5PsDYDdz_childItem_0": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
