        "ggT0gKMw19N_text": "<p><strong>I Cancelled Three Other Supplements</strong></p>",
        "ggKXHLu_GhE_text": "<p>I was spending $140/month on biotin, iron, collagen, and a hair growth serum that stained my pillowcase. My shower drain was still full every morning. One jar of Himalayan Shilajit Gummies replaced the entire stack. By week 8, I stopped counting hairs on my pillow. By month 3, my hairdresser asked what I changed. Simpler, cheaper, and my hair is actually staying on my head.</p>",
